      "description": "<p>You open a rift filled with malice, dread, and disease, condemning those pulled into it to overwhelming darkness. <strong>Choose one option</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>One creature you can see suffers <strong>50</strong> <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-id=\"tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-type=\"Item\">Poison</a> damage and becomes <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.JltwIqzHbBKhkD45\" data-id=\"JltwIqzHbBKhkD45\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\">Poisoned</a></p></li><li><p>You choose any number of creatures you can see, and each of them suffers <strong>30</strong> <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-id=\"vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-type=\"Item\">Dark</a> damage and cannot choose any of the other chosen creatures as targets for effects this round.</p></li></ul><p>This spell ignores damage Resistances and Immunities, as well as condition immunities.</p><hr class=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p><strong>Skill Enhancement Lv. 20</strong> ― This damage increase by <strong>5</strong></p><p><strong>Skill Enhancement Lv. 40</strong> ― This damage increase by <strong>10</strong></p>",
